#: ../../../users/metrics.rst:2
msgid "Prometheus-Style Metrics"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../users/metrics.rst:4
msgid ""
"Syncthing provides an endpoint for Prometheus-style metrics. Metrics are "
"served on the ``/metrics`` path on the GUI / API address. The metrics "
"endpoint requires authentication when the GUI / API is configured to require "
"authentication; see :doc:`/dev/rest` for details."
msgstr ""

